## Build outputs
# Anchored to the project root so they match build output only. Unanchored,
# "[Dd]ebug/" also swallowed SexyBiscuit.Engine/Debug/, the profiler and gizmo
# source folder.
**/bin/[Dd]ebug/
**/bin/[Rr]elease/
**/obj/[Dd]ebug/
**/obj/[Rr]elease/

## IDE
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

## OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

## Editor dist
SexyBiscuit.Editor/dist/

## ImGui writes its window layout beside the working directory, which is the
## repository root when the editor is launched by its dll path rather than from
## its own folder. Unanchored, so it is ignored wherever the editor is run from.
imgui.ini
imgui.layout-version

## Build output of any project or game (web exports, publishes, archives)
dist/

## Per-project scratch folders (generated player project, usage logs, autosaves)
.sexybiscuit/

## Claude Code worktrees (created by --worktree / EnterWorktree)
.claude/worktrees/

## Per-machine Claude Code permissions
.claude/settings.local.json
